          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ka Parao kabaka me Ejipt onenogi ducu, cwinye bikwe pi tone kekene ki pi to pa askari me monnye ma ginekogi woko i lweny-nyi.’ Man Rwot Lubaŋa ma owaco.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.31",
